HaishinKit RTC includes libdatachannel 0.24.7 (MPL-2.0) and its pinned
libjuice (MPL-2.0), libsrtp (BSD-3-Clause), usrsctp (BSD-3-Clause),
plog (MIT), nlohmann/json (MIT), and Mbed TLS 3.6.5 (Apache-2.0) dependencies.
License texts are included in this directory.

Upstream libdatachannel source and dependency revisions:
https://github.com/paullouisageneau/libdatachannel/tree/800e849a1ede5667caaf8f6caa1eb21e4906dd87
https://github.com/paullouisageneau/libdatachannel/blob/800e849a1ede5667caaf8f6caa1eb21e4906dd87/.gitmodules
Local modification: WebSocket IPv6 URL parsing uses POSIX bracket expressions
compatible with libc++. The complete change is included alongside this notice
in websocket-url-regex.patch and applied by rtc/src/main/cpp/CMakeLists.txt.
Mbed TLS source:
https://github.com/Mbed-TLS/mbedtls/releases/tag/mbedtls-3.6.5
The HaishinKit build enables MBEDTLS_SSL_DTLS_SRTP via a user config header.
